Subject: [PATCH] Fix+Feat: critical build errors + STE V2+ (contraintes +
 backtracking + Pareto)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

CRITICAL BUILP FIXES (blocked Vercel + Fly.io):
- prisma/schema.prisma: duplicate TeacherAvailability model (line 1134 + 7789)
  → renamed STE-side to TimetableTeacherAvailability (same @@map table, raw SQL unchanged)
- SubjectsWorkspace.tsx: 3 unclosed braces in pedagogyFetch POST/PATCH calls
  (lines 493/527/581) → fixed + removed unused BilingualTrack import

STE V2+ (replaces V1):
Backend (timetable-engine.service.ts + controller.ts):
- 6 constraint types: SUBJECT_TIME_WINDOW, TEACHER_MAX_DAILY, SUBJECT_DISTRIBUTION,
  SUBJECT_NOT_CONSECUTIVE, CLASS_FREE_SLOT, TEACHER_PREFERRED_DAY
- CRUD: GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /constraints + GET /constraints/types
- Backtracking récursif (maxDepth 500) avec undo
- Multi-solutions Pareto: generateMulti() lance 5 stratégies
  (feasibility, preference, pedagogy, comfort, random) + computeParetoFront()
- Scoring V2+: 4 critères + pénalité SOFT (0.5×somme weights)
- Endpoint POST /generate-multi

Frontend (TimetablesWorkspace.tsx):
- 6-onglets interface: Config / Disponibilités / Contraintes / Génération / Solutions / Édition manuelle
- ConstraintsTab: liste + modal création avec ParamsEditor dynamique
- GenerateTab: toggle Mono/Multi-Pareto
- SolutionsTab: badges PARETO + strategy + violated SOFT
- ManualTimetablesEditor.tsx: legacy editor preserved as 6th tab
- timetables/page.tsx: dynamic KPIs from STE solutions
- timetable-engine/page.tsx: redirect to /timetables
- proxy route.ts: +DELETE handler

